$DATUM Coupling of 215 and 316 (6 equiv of K2CO3, 5 equiv of 18-c-6, 0.1 M DMSO,
14 h, 25°C) provided 4 (70%), Scheme 1. 4: [α]25 D +45.0 (c 1.8, CHCl3);
1H NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz) δ 8.07 (d, J = 7.0 Hz, 1H), 7.91 (d, J = 8.2 Hz,
